Package: nanokvm-audio-streamer
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: alsa-utils
Description: HTTP audio streamer for the NanoKVM / LicheeRV Nano MEMS microphone
 Captures the onboard MEMS microphone of a Sipeed NanoKVM (LicheeRV Nano)
 and serves it to any HTTP client as a lossless 48 kHz mono WAV (LPCM)
 stream. It runs as a systemd service, listens on port 8080 by default, and
 exposes a small JSON health endpoint for monitoring.
 .
 The microphone hears the room around the KVM, not the attached host's HDMI
 audio. The stream is unauthenticated: run it on a trusted LAN only.
